open:kudosTo open:markdownDescription """For example, if you have a DOAP project and want to ack some input re contribution, tester, feedback, etc. you would go like:

    :myproject a doap:Project ;
               ov:kudos :John .

or, on a more personal level, it would be:

    :me ov:kudos :John ."""@en;
             label:plural "kudos to"@en;
             dir:etag """\"cd58f6d1-d6a7-45f6-9de0-67b0ac5c4d84\"""";
             a rdf:Property;
